# Google Search Console service-account credentials (frontend/scripts/gsc-report.mjs).
# The key should normally live OUTSIDE the repo entirely — see growth/GSC_API_SETUP.md.
# These patterns are a safety net in case one ends up under the repo anyway.
gsc-service-account*.json
*gsc*key*.json
growth/*credentials*.json
growth/*service-account*.json
